From 64c9bb7006537403206c7381e5d943703335bc50 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lolzen <funer@gmx.at>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:36:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] screenreader: Restart Orca on failure without systemd --user

orca.service restarts Orca when it fails. The child process that stands in
for it without a user service manager now does the same, with systemd's
defaults: after 100 ms, at most five starts within ten seconds. A clean
exit or a stop is not restarted.
---
 steamos-manager/src/screenreader.rs |   5 +-
 steamos-manager/src/user_service.rs | 254 +++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 216 insertions(+), 43 deletions(-)

